  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "◆测试是否已完成《凤鸣之塔》任务方法：",
      "type": "prerequisite-check-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "前往伊尔村与渔夫欧姆豪克（31.45）对话。",
      "type": "prerequisite-check",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "已完成《风鸣之塔》任务，对话提示为『什么？你想要这个镜子！？』",
      "type": "completed-dialogue",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "未完成《风鸣之塔》任务，对话提示为『自从我在还上钓到一个怪东西后就来了一堆讨厌的想抢的人···真是受不了。』",
      "type": "incomplete-dialogue",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "◆每名队员准备一个【神眼】；可通过击倒角笛大风穴内的水蜘蛛获得，不可交易。参考《没落的村庄》任务。",
      "type": "party-item-source",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "1.前往杰诺瓦镇，出镇东门至莎莲娜岛（281.370）处与丧尸对话进入战斗。战斗胜利后队伍中一人随机获得【塔比欧的细胞】。",
      "type": "battle-drop",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "◆【塔比欧的细胞】队伍中一人持有即可，不可交易。",
      "type": "item-scope",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "◆培养型丧尸，等级随机；技能：攻击、防御、诸刃",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "2.前往莎莲娜岛（313.432）处与魔族研究专家帕席对话，选“是”交出【塔比欧的细胞】获得【月之锄头】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "3.前往莎莲娜岛（356~373.345~450）处附近寻找随机出现的黄色传送石，进入后抵达奇怪的坑道。",
      "type": "maze-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "◆奇怪的坑道为随机迷宫，随机12~16层；迷宫刷新时间：4小时（仅供参考），地图大小范围：50*50~60*60；宝箱数量：7；",
      "type": "maze-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "魔物为Lv26~31的烈风哥布林、果冻史莱姆、破坏狂，最高遇敌数量8，有战斗经验",
      "type": "maze-encounter",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "4.寻找迷宫内随机出现的挖掘的迪太，持有【月之锄头】交出后持有者获得【红色三棱镜】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "◆只有拥有【月之锄头】会获得【红色三棱镜】，全队只需要一个即可。",
      "type": "party-scope",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "5.通过随机迷宫，进入红色传送石（10.15），与迪次郎（9.5）对话清除【红色三棱镜】，进入战斗。",
      "type": "battle-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "◆Lv.39迪次郎，血量约1000；技能：攻击、防御、圣盾",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "◆游戏时间一天内只能挑战一次BOSS，如果第二次进入会没收三棱镜并且无法挑战，如需挑战第二次请换线或者等游戏内一天过后",
      "type": "daily-limit",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "6.战斗胜利后，全队传送至地下水脉。",
      "type": "teleport-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "◆地下水脉，固定地图，魔物：丧尸、食尸鬼、僵尸、木乃伊Lv.28~30，有战斗经验",
      "type": "encounter-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "Lv.1烈风哥布林，捕捉范围（44~45.55~56）",
      "type": "capture-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "◆若进入旁边的传送石传出迷宫，需关闭游戏，重新登录后选择其他线路重接",
      "type": "failure-restart",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "7.队伍中一人可花费30000G向守门的食尸鬼购买【黑暗医师项链】（守门的食尸鬼：想回去吗？ 此时选“是”后出现购买选项），全队通过栅栏。",
      "type": "purchase-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "◆若拒绝或无钱购买【黑暗医师项链】，则传送至黑暗医生集团总部，与黑暗医生阿鲁巴斯对话传送至莎莲娜岛（281.370）处，魅力减去1点",
      "type": "failure-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "◆若队伍中一人持有【黑暗医生的象征】或【护士帽】，可以替代【黑暗医师项链】。",
      "type": "alternate-item-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "【黑暗医生的象征】与【护士帽】获得方法参考《诱拐事件》任务；二者皆可交易。",
      "type": "item-source",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "◆黑暗医师项链：Lv.1项链、耐久289；可以交易。",
      "type": "equipment-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        26
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "text": "任何职业装备【黑暗医师项链】后，与管理称号的NPC对话可获得称号“黑暗医生公会会员”。",
      "type": "equipment-title",
      "sourceLines": [
        27
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "text": "8.通过栅栏后向右走，与凯欧斯威普（47.32）对话，选“是”通过。至（50.32）处传送至地底的龟裂处，通过黄色传送石（14.7）进入深渊。",
      "type": "abyss-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        28
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "text": "◆与凯欧斯威普对话无法通过，则说明未完成《风鸣之塔》任务",
      "type": "prerequisite-block",
      "sourceLines": [
        29
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 30,
      "text": "◆无法进入深渊：",
      "type": "inventory-block-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        30
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
      "text": "持有【黑之记忆】、【白之记忆】、【黑之意志】、【白之意志】、【迷惑的意志】中任意一种道具无法进入深渊",
      "type": "inventory-block",
      "sourceLines": [
        31
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 32,
      "text": "◆深渊为随机迷宫，共36层；迷宫刷新时间：4小时（仅供参考），地图大小范围：40*40~60*60；宝箱数量：18；",
      "type": "maze-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        32
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 33,
      "text": "魔物为Lv54~63的地龙蜥、火龙蜥、猎豹蜥蜴、蜥蜴斗士，最高遇敌数量7，有战斗经验",
      "type": "maze-encounter",
      "sourceLines": [
        33
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 34,
      "text": "9.通过随机迷宫抵达黑之祭坛，持有【神眼】调查壁画（20.8），交出【神眼】进入战斗。",
      "type": "solo-battle-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        34
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 35,
      "text": "◆战斗信息：（BOSS战不可组队，需单挑）",
      "type": "solo-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        35
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 36,
      "text": "Lv.60龙的使者，血量约6700，邪魔系，属性：全50，不抗咒；技能：攻击、冰冻魔法（伤害固定为1）、强力冰冻魔法（伤害固定为1）",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        36
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 37,
      "text": "10.战斗胜利后获得【世界之心】，与龙的使者（15.21）对话，选“是”获得【黑之记忆】并传送回召唤之间，任务完结。",
      "type": "choice-reward",
      "sourceLines": [
        37
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 38,
      "text": "◆【黑之记忆】，用于《黑白龙城》任务。",
      "type": "future-use",
      "sourceLines": [
        38
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 39,
      "text": "亦可用于特殊情况下返回法兰城用：",
      "type": "escape-use",
      "sourceLines": [
        39
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 40,
      "text": "双击使用后传送到龙族祭坛，和下面的龙对话传送到询问之地，和上面的龙对话重新获得记忆并返回召唤之间。",
      "type": "escape-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        40
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 41,
      "text": "◆选“否”不会获得道具，传送回地下水脉，任务完结",
      "type": "no-item-ending",
      "sourceLines": [
        41
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 42,
      "text": "◆任务剧情：参考《龙族的纷争系列任务剧情对话》",
      "type": "story-reference",
      "sourceLines": [
        42
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    }
